{
  "title": "Differentiation — the gradient of a curve",
  "slides": [
    {
      "id": "car",
      "title": "How fast, right now?",
      "kp_ids": [
        "d1"
      ],
      "idea": "Speed is how steep the distance-time graph is; between two times we can find the average speed, but not yet the speed at one instant.",
      "check": "Between t = 1 s and t = 3 s the car goes from 1 m to 9 m. What was its average speed?",
      "objects": [
        {
          "kind": "axes",
          "id": "ax",
          "x": 140,
          "y": 170,
          "w": 880,
          "h": 600,
          "x_range": [
            0,
            5.5
          ],
          "y_range": [
            0,
            30
          ],
          "x_label": "time t (s)",
          "y_label": "distance d (m)"
        },
        {
          "kind": "curve",
          "id": "road",
          "axes": "ax",
          "expr": "x^2",
          "color": "blue",
          "label": "d = t²",
          "x_range": [
            0,
            5.4
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "dot",
          "id": "car",
          "axes": "ax",
          "x": 0,
          "color": "white",
          "curve": "road"
        },
        {
          "kind": "text",
          "id": "car_l",
          "text": "car",
          "x": 2.6,
          "y": 11.5,
          "size": 28,
          "axes": "ax"
        },
        {
          "kind": "dot",
          "id": "later",
          "axes": "ax",
          "x": 5,
          "color": "white",
          "curve": "road"
        },
        {
          "kind": "polyline",
          "id": "chord",
          "axes": "ax",
          "points": [
            [
              3,
              9
            ],
            [
              5,
              25
            ]
          ],
          "color": "yellow"
        },
        {
          "kind": "polyline",
          "id": "run",
          "axes": "ax",
          "points": [
            [
              3,
              9
            ],
            [
              5,
              9
            ]
          ],
          "color": "green"
        },
        {
          "kind": "polyline",
          "id": "rise",
          "axes": "ax",
          "points": [
            [
              5,
              9
            ],
            [
              5,
              25
            ]
          ],
          "color": "purple"
        },
        {
          "kind": "text",
          "id": "run_l",
          "text": "2 s",
          "x": 4,
          "y": 7.2,
          "size": 28,
          "color": "green",
          "axes": "ax"
        },
        {
          "kind": "text",
          "id": "rise_l",
          "text": "16 m",
          "x": 5.1,
          "y": 17,
          "size": 28,
          "color": "purple",
          "axes": "ax",
          "align": "left"
        },
        {
          "kind": "text",
          "id": "q",
          "text": "How fast is the car going\nat exactly t = 3 s?",
          "x": 1300,
          "y": 250,
          "size": 34
        },
        {
          "kind": "math",
          "id": "avg",
          "latex": "\\text{average speed} = \\frac{\\textcolor{#B08CD9}{16\\text{ m}}}{\\textcolor{#83C167}{2\\text{ s}}}",
          "x": 1300,
          "y": 430,
          "size": 40
        },
        {
          "kind": "math",
          "id": "avg2",
          "latex": "= \\textcolor{#FFE45C}{8\\text{ m/s}}",
          "x": 1300,
          "y": 530,
          "size": 44
        },
        {
          "kind": "text",
          "id": "slow",
          "text": "But it was still speeding up,\nso at t = 3 it was slower than 8.",
          "x": 1300,
          "y": 680,
          "size": 28,
          "color": "grey"
        }
      ],
      "steps": [
        {
          "narration": "Here's a car pulling away from traffic lights. Across is time in seconds, up is how far it has gone in metres.",
          "actions": [
            {
              "do": "show",
              "ids": [
                "ax",
                "road"
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "narration": "Watch where it is after each second: it covers more ground every second, so it's speeding up.",
          "actions": [
            {
              "do": "show",
              "ids": [
                "car"
              ]
            },
            {
              "do": "path",
              "id": "car",
              "xs": [
                1,
                2,
                3
              ]
            },
            {
              "do": "show",
              "ids": [
                "car_l"
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "narration": "So here's our question: how fast is it going at exactly three seconds? Have a guess before we work anything out.",
          "actions": [
            {
              "do": "show",
              "ids": [
                "q"
              ]
            },
            {
              "do": "indicate",
              "ids": [
                "car"
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "narration": "One thing we can work out is the average speed from three to five seconds, so join those two moments with a straight yellow line.",
          "actions": [
            {
              "do": "show",
              "ids": [
                "later",
                "chord"
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "narration": "In those 2 seconds it goes from 9 metres to 25 metres: that's 16 metres.",
          "actions": [
            {
              "do": "show",
              "ids": [
                "run",
                "run_l",
                "rise",
                "rise_l"
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "narration": "Distance over time is 16 over 2, so 8 metres per second. That's exactly how steep the yellow line is.",
          "actions": [
            {
              "do": "show",
              "ids": [
                "avg",
                "avg2"
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "narration": "But the car was still speeding up, so at three seconds it was going slower than 8. To get the speed at one instant, we need to measure steepness properly.",
          "actions": [
            {
              "do": "show",
              "ids": [
                "slow"
              ]
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "line",
      "title": "Gradient of a straight line",
      "kp_ids": [
        "d2"
      ],
      "builds_on": "car",
      "idea": "The gradient of a straight line is rise divided by run, and it is the same between any two points on the line.",
      "check": "What is the gradient of the line through (0, 1) and (2, 7)?",
      "objects": [
        {
          "kind": "axes",
          "id": "ax",
          "x": 140,
          "y": 170,
          "w": 820,
          "h": 600,
          "x_range": [
            0,
            5
          ],
          "y_range": [
            0,
            12
          ],
          "x_label": "x",
          "y_label": "y"
        },
        {
          "kind": "curve",
          "id": "line",
          "axes": "ax",
          "expr": "2*x+1",
          "color": "yellow",
          "label": "y = 2x + 1"
        },
        {
          "kind": "dot",
          "id": "a",
          "axes": "ax",
          "x": 1,
          "color": "white",
          "curve": "line"
        },
        {
          "kind": "dot",
          "id": "b",
          "axes": "ax",
          "x": 4,
          "color": "white",
          "curve": "line"
        },
        {
          "kind": "text",
          "id": "a_l",
          "text": "(1, 3)",
          "x": 1.12,
          "y": 2.3,
          "size": 26,
          "axes": "ax",
          "align": "left"
        },
        {
          "kind": "text",
          "id": "b_l",
          "text": "(4, 9)",
          "x": 4.12,
          "y": 8.6,
          "size": 26,
          "axes": "ax",
          "align": "left"
        },
        {
          "kind": "polyline",
          "id": "run",
          "axes": "ax",
          "points": [
            [
              1,
              3
            ],
            [
              4,
              3
            ]
          ],
          "color": "green"
        },
        {
          "kind": "text",
          "id": "run_l",
          "text": "run = 3",
          "x": 2.5,
          "y": 2.3,
          "size": 28,
          "color": "green",
          "axes": "ax"
        },
        {
          "kind": "polyline",
          "id": "rise",
          "axes": "ax",
          "points": [
            [
              4,
              3
            ],
            [
              4,
              9
            ]
          ],
          "color": "purple"
        },
        {
          "kind": "text",
          "id": "rise_l",
          "text": "rise = 6",
          "x": 4.12,
          "y": 6,
          "size": 28,
          "color": "purple",
          "axes": "ax",
          "align": "left"
        },
        {
          "kind": "math",
          "id": "g",
          "latex": "\\text{gradient} = \\frac{\\textcolor{#B08CD9}{\\text{rise}}}{\\textcolor{#83C167}{\\text{run}}}",
          "x": 1290,
          "y": 250,
          "size": 44
        },
        {
          "kind": "math",
          "id": "g_n",
          "latex": "= \\frac{\\textcolor{#B08CD9}{6}}{\\textcolor{#83C167}{3}} = \\textcolor{#FFE45C}{2}",
          "x": 1290,
          "y": 370,
          "size": 44
        },
        {
          "kind": "polyline",
          "id": "run2",
          "axes": "ax",
          "points": [
            [
              2,
              5
            ],
            [
              3,
              5
            ]
          ],
          "color": "green"
        },
        {
          "kind": "polyline",
          "id": "rise2",
          "axes": "ax",
          "points": [
            [
              3,
              5
            ],
            [
              3,
              7
            ]
          ],
          "color": "purple"
        },
        {
          "kind": "text",
          "id": "run2_l",
          "text": "1",
          "x": 2.5,
          "y": 4.45,
          "size": 28,
          "color": "green",
          "axes": "ax"
        },
        {
          "kind": "text",
          "id": "rise2_l",
          "text": "2",
          "x": 3.1,
          "y": 6,
          "size": 28,
          "color": "purple",
          "axes": "ax",
          "align": "left"
        },
        {
          "kind": "math",
          "id": "g2",
          "latex": "\\frac{\\textcolor{#B08CD9}{2}}{\\textcolor{#83C167}{1}} = \\textcolor{#FFE45C}{2} \\text{ again}",
          "x": 1290,
          "y": 510,
          "size": 40
        },
        {
          "kind": "math",
          "id": "rule",
          "latex": "m = \\frac{\\textcolor{#B08CD9}{y_2 - y_1}}{\\textcolor{#83C167}{x_2 - x_1}}",
          "x": 1290,
          "y": 670,
          "size": 44
        }
      ],
      "steps": [
        {
          "narration": "The car's average speed was the steepness of a straight line, so let's measure straight lines properly. Here's y = 2x + 1, through (1, 3) and (4, 9).",
          "actions": [
            {
              "do": "show",
              "ids": [
                "ax",
                "line",
                "a",
                "a_l",
                "b",
                "b_l"
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "narration": "From the first point to the second we go 3 across: that's the run.",
          "actions": [
            {
              "do": "show",
              "ids": [
                "run",
                "run_l"
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "narration": "And we go 6 up: that's the rise.",
          "actions": [
            {
              "do": "show",
              "ids": [
                "rise",
                "rise_l"
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "narration": "Gradient is rise over run: 6 over 3 is 2. The line goes up 2 for every 1 across.",
          "actions": [
            {
              "do": "show",
              "ids": [
                "g",
                "g_n"
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "narration": "Now take a different pair of points on the same line. What do you think the gradient will be this time?",
          "actions": [
            {
              "do": "hide",
              "ids": [
                "run",
                "run_l",
                "rise",
                "rise_l"
              ]
            },
            {
              "do": "show",
              "ids": [
                "run2",
                "rise2"
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "narration": "Across 1, up 2: the gradient is 2 again. A straight line is equally steep everywhere.",
          "actions": [
            {
              "do": "show",
              "ids": [
                "run2_l",
                "rise2_l",
                "g2"
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "narration": "In symbols, the gradient m is the change in y over the change in x.",
          "actions": [
            {
              "do": "show",
              "ids": [
                "rule"
              ]
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
